    "zh": "从左到右是启动链路：Entry 按次序拉起各管理器 → MonoManager 提供帧驱动与协程 → ScenesLoadManager 是全工程唯一调 SceneManager 的地方 → LoadingController 持控读条与激活 → 场景资产由构建清单决定哪些能被加载。",
    "en": "Left to right is the boot chain: Entry brings the managers up in order → MonoManager supplies the tick and coroutines → ScenesLoadManager is the only caller of SceneManager → LoadingController owns the bar and activation → the build list decides which scenes can be loaded."
